  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p>You only require a swift action to intentionally search for stimulus using Perception, to search for tracks using Survival, or when attempting to appraise an item, deduce the use of an item, or evaluate a service using Appraise. You also only suffer a -5 penalty when attempting to Appraise as a free action (instead of the normal -10).</p>\n<p>Additionally, you only require a standard action to sense a creature’s immediate goal or attempt to sense emotion to learn more (or try again) about the creature’s emotional state.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/investigation#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
